# A2_2 "Sixth House Base": Caius sends the player to the Sixth House shrine at
# Ilunibi, where the priest Dagoth Gares greets Lord Nerevar and, dying, curses
# the player with corprus.
# PositionCell stands in for the walks; damage stands in for the fight, and ref
# FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from a2_2_orders
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# "I'm ready for anything" and a Continue: the mission, 400 drakes, and Dagoth
# Gares enabled.
case a2_2_orders
run
player->PositionCell -35 -110 80 180 "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House"
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Caius Cosades' House" == 1
talk caius cosades
ask Orders
choose 1
choose 3
expect GetJournalIndex A2_2_6thHouse == 5
bye
end

# Near the player his script force-greets; he speaks for his lord.
case a2_2_gares
run
player->PositionCell 4159 4486 12224 0 "Ilunibi, Soul's Rattle"
until 600 GetPCCell "Ilunibi, Soul's Rattle" == 1
until 600 MenuMode == 1
ask Dagoth Ur
expect GetJournalIndex A2_2_6thHouse == 40
ask Sixth House
expect GetJournalIndex A2_2_6thHouse == 42
ask Lord's friendship
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex A2_2_6thHouse == 49
bye
end

# His dying curse: corprus, a message box, and the journal.
case a2_2_curse
console 05D254C5.damageav health 10000
button 0
until 300 "dagoth gares"->GetHealth <= 0
until 300 GetJournalIndex A2_2_6thHouse == 50
expect player->GetSpell Corprus == 1
end
